{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Knowing the Two-Weapon Fighting fighting style.\n\nYou master fighting with two weapons, gaining the following benefits:\n\n- Increase your Strength or Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- You gain a +1 bonus to AC while you are wielding a separate melee weapon in each hand.\n\n- You can use two-weapon fighting even when the one-handed melee weapons you are wielding aren\u0027t light.\n\n- When you use your bonus action on your turn to attack with a one-handed melee weapon as part of the two weapon fighting rules, you can make one additional attack as part of the same bonus action. If you are using the Nick property of a Light melee weapon, you can instead make two attacks without using your bonus action with that property.\n\n- You can draw or stow two one-handed weapons when you would normally be able to draw or stow only one","level":1}],"id":"Custom58cc34f0-b543-426f-adc9-920aa81a76d2","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Dual Wielder [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}